      "description": "Arrows Puzzle is a direction-and-path planning puzzle game. Tap arrows in the correct order and help them escape before time runs out.\nWith 1000+ levels and increasing difficulty, it offers a clean, focused puzzle experience for both casual players and logic lovers.\n\n1.Pure puzzle gameplay focused on the core challenge\n2.A rich level set with ongoing challenges\n3.Fast-paced sessions that balance casual play and brain training\n4.Apple Watch supported—play a quick round anytime",
